BigFatFish Douyin adapters

LockyBee/dsh-douyin-agent, commit 7989640e340f0fd79e2de9874880d5197546e755, MIT.
lockybee/core.mjs is a recorded subset of upstream core.mjs. Original video identity,
DOM observation, proof verification, temporal sampling and audio capture algorithms
are retained. The constructor accepts only an already-owned Playwright Page.
Standalone memory/persona/limits/launcher/brain imports and unused operations are
removed. lockybee/bff.patch applies to the fixed original core.mjs.
Original license is retained at lockybee/LICENSE.

kdcadmin/dsh_douyin_tools, commit aaf9f9a862afafd45a15acf32789da97688de695, MIT.
The full vendor/douyin-mcp/mcp_server.py is retained in services/douyin with a patch
removing implicit home/CDP fallbacks and making all final-submit markers await a
one-call Runtime guard; stable-recipient checks and strict new sent-message receipts
replace body-text/count fallbacks; pre-submit stable-ID baselines include hidden nodes.
Comment receipts bind exact request and response, with explicit, consistent parent aliases;
publish response alone remains unverified without media identity binding. The runtime whitelist excludes independent memory, watch,
Whisper, SMS and other standalone application tools. No unrelated vendor code is
copied. Original license is retained at services/douyin/LICENSE.

No separate npm workspace or independent model/personality/memory process is loaded.
Node Playwright and the Python protocol dependencies retain their installed licenses.
